r entertainment or immersive learning, you are no longer a spectator\u2014you are part of the scene.\nEarly Access & PGC Platform:\nWe are building the ultimate destination for Professional Generated Content (PGC) in spatial video. During our Early Access launch, enjoy our curated library of premium 4D experiences completely FREE.\n\nDownload Vivid 4D today and step inside the video.", "short_description": "Experience photorealistic, moving humans in your room with Vivid 4D. Powered by 4D Gaussian Splatting, this free MR player lets you walk around life-sized performances in 6DoF."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://674312358-sudo.github.io/vivid-4d-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Prometheus ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.prometh.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "34354894150790464"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2380798499058497"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2380798499058497"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1773366120, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2380798499058497"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "34532353586377852", "version": "1.0